				<h2 style="text-align: left;">Job Spec:</h2>
				<p>iDAL is looking to hire a Community Manager and Brand Ambassador to represent and promote iDAL and the culture of modelpreneurship, and be the first point of contact for our model community.</p>
				
				<h3>Responsibilities</h3>
				<ul>
					<li>Raising awareness around the need to change the opaque modelling industry, through social media channels and events.</li>
					<li>Promoting iDAL’s mission, talent board and the culture of modelpreneurship.</li>
					<li>Producing & curating content for iDAL’s social media channels.</li>
					<li>Acting as spokesperson for iDAL on social media and offline.</li> 
					<li>Giving interviews to media about iDAL when required.</li>
					<li>Managing, attending and sometimes leading the monthly iDAL Voices events.</li>
					<li>Leading the verification  & curation process for models on the platform.</li>
					<li>Ensuring iDAL models are aware of castings & jobs and attend them on time.</li>
				</ul>
				
				<h3>Specific Skills needed</h3>
				<ul>
					<li>Professional modelling experience, having worked for major fashion shows, events and e-commerce platforms.</li> 
					<li>Professional Influencer+Model Social Media presence > 50k followers</li>
					<li>Strong written and verbal communication skills.</li>
					<li>Ability to remain calm under pressure.</
					<li>Ability to work flexibly in a team.</li>
				</ul>
				
				<h3>Person Specification</h3>
				<ul>
					<li>Highly motivated.</li>
					<li>Positive outlook, enthusiastic and friendly.</li>
					<li>Takes ownership, is reliable and meets deadlines.</li>
					<li>Highly articulate with excellent written and verbal communication skills.</li>
				</ul>
				
				<p>&nbsp;</p>
